@Touristy.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5128

### Book a room (valid request -> 200 OK)
POST {{Touristy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/RoomBooking
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ubaid ur Rehman",
  "email": "ubaid@example.com",
  "date": "2027-01-15"
}

### Invalid request: bad email and past date (-> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{Touristy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/RoomBooking
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ubaid ur Rehman",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "date": "2020-01-01"
}

###
